yam (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Ships libyam as a shared library (libyam0) plus development files
    (libyam-dev): headers, static library, pkg-config, and dev symlink.
  * SSE4.2 SIMD scanner path is selected at runtime, so the portable build
    uses SIMD on capable CPUs without requiring -march=native.

 -- Thomas Sawyer <transfire@gmail.com>  Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
